            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuEnergySensor.cpp",
                    "line": 56,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "JY-Voon",
                        "email": "jvoon@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "JY-Voon"
                    },
                    "message": "Can we perform the initialization in the initializer list?\nI think we might have to modify the encode function to be able to do that.\nBut this help us make `request` become `const`."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuEnergySensor.cpp",
                    "line": 56,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ender",
                        "email": "andhsieh@nvidia.com",
                        "username": "Ender-Hsieh"
                    },
                    "message": "Done. Added value-returning encode*Request(...) overloads in NvidiaGpuMctpVdm. request is now a const member, and the requestEncoded flag and the update() guard are removed."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/nvidia-gpu/NvidiaGpuEnergySensor.cpp",
                    "line": 162,
                    "reviewer": {
